    {
      "table": "ui",
      "key": "Each row scores the same saved fit on the labelled population; no refit is performed. R^2 uses 100 bins between the finite population 0.5th and 99.5th percentiles, with the existing finite-cell density scaling. The production verdict uses all finite scored cells.",
      "source": "Each row scores the same saved fit on the labelled population; no refit is performed. R^2 uses 100 bins between the finite population 0.5th and 99.5th percentiles, with the existing finite-cell density scaling. The production verdict uses all finite scored cells.",
      "source_sha256": "b789f8bc2ceb383dd612c6bec6789b729ba06315e8a2db1ffdea4f30bd711cd0",
      "translation": "Cada fila evalúa el mismo ajuste guardado en la población indicada; no se realiza ningún nuevo ajuste. R^2 utiliza 100 intervalos entre los percentiles 0.5 y 99.5 de la población con valores finitos, con el escalado de densidad existente para las células con valores finitos. La decisión de producción utiliza todas las células evaluadas con valores finitos."
